config INPUT_STTS22H
         tristate "STM STTS22H sensor"
         depends on I2C && SYSFS
         help
           This driver support the STMicroelectronics STTS22H temperature sensor.

	   To compile this driver as a module, choose M here. The module
	   will be called stts22h.

